ng vintage objects, photographs and ephemera, the narrator takes us on a poignant quest, from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aySDgt6fNvsQ7kNvwFUTY32&_nc_oc=Adl7sctcEsGRNSnK5kgroCtaYb80Qh08T2MC4TxjJLx0aagp_nMINJhJ80Y1yJH2oxE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwPhADkfmTtb-x6a1hgEUDB4tzZsmjYQxqJB9LyAG7YvA&oe=69BE7E81"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WJ2TisByeHAQ7kNvwHc68O9&_nc_oc=AdlPyCIC6ZLo67K1kobaExxqJha5m0hgfqfNv4RuVKoEeMznzRhdk1Ew3PCC4JptWcQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzrMCrb5LLWIoDX3BpBBlB-5wIFzOKKacsz77Q4O82gdw&oe=69BE8BE6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GxnRlqk7bG0Q7kNvwG7Vl3D&_nc_oc=AdnrbkWX2XQ4l5Dnx7qOsqgeTGN3KBg7Bb1glrSA4whstkWqHpRje2e_Gp--gxYmw-Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss